          <aside class="wb-nav-preview" aria-label="侧栏效果预览"><div class="wb-nav-preview-heading"><span><svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8a4 4 0 1 1 0 8 4 4 0 0 1 0-8 M20 4C13-1-1 13 4 20S25 11 20 4 M3 6h.01 M20 19h.01"/></svg></span><strong>侧栏效果</strong><small>同步预览</small></div><ul><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8a4 4 0 1 1 0 8 4 4 0 0 1 0-8 M20 4C13-1-1 13 4 20S25 11 20 4 M3 6h.01 M20 19h.01"/></svg><span>我的工作台</span></li><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m2 8 10-5 10 5-10 5z M2 12l10 5 10-5 M2 16l10 5 10-5"/></svg><span>搭建台</span></li><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 2.5 6.5L21 12l-6.5 2.5L12 21l-2.5-6.5L3 12l6.5-2.5z M20 2v4 M18 4h4"/></svg><span>AI伙伴</span></li></ul><p class="wb-nav-preview-empty">暂时没有收进“更多”的入口</p><p class="wb-nav-preview-note">隐藏入口不会移除首页方块，也不会删除资料。</p></aside></div>
          <p class="wb-nav-status" data-navigation-status role="status">调整后自动保存，只改变侧栏入口。</p><p class="wb-nav-footnote">这里只管理已加入的模块与空间。新增模块后会自动出现；偏好与连接等底部工具保持固定。</p>
        </div></details></div>
    
        <div data-wb-placement-host><section class="wb-placement" aria-labelledby="wb-placement-title">
        <div class="wb-placement-heading"><div><h2 id="wb-placement-title">像摆积木一样，搭好你的工作台</h2><p>选一块，放到右边。这里的位置，会直接成为你的工作台布局。</p></div><span class="wb-placement-count">1 块已放置</span></div>
        <div class="wb-placement-workspace"><aside class="wb-palette" aria-label="方块库"><header><h3>方块库</h3><p>直接拖到右边，也可点选后放下</p><button type="button" class="wb-palette-create" data-wb-action="create-block"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14 M5 12h14"/></svg> 自定义方块</button><button type="button" class="wb-palette-ai" data-wb-action="ask-miniapp"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 2.5 6.5L21 12l-6.5 2.5L12 21l-2.5-6.5L3 12l6.5-2.5z M20 2v4 M18 4h4"/></svg> 让 AI 造小工具</button></header>
