th d="M4 4h16l2 12v4H2v-4z M2 15h6l2 3h4l2-3h6"/></svg><span>灵感收集箱</span></li><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 12l2 2 5-5 M21 11v1a9 9 0 1 1-5-8"/></svg><span>备忘与待办</span></li><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 3v18h17 M8 16v-4 M13 16V7 M18 16v-7"/></svg><span>生活回顾</span></li><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 8V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a3 3 0 0 0 0 6h15v11H5a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V6 M20 12h-5v5h5 M16 14.5h.01"/></svg><span>记账</span></li><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v16H4z M8 2v6 M16 2v6 M4 11h16"/></svg><span>日历</span></li><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 4h18v17H3z M3 9h18 M8 9v12 M14 9v12 M3 15h18 M7 2v4 M17 2v4"/></svg><span>学期课表</span></li><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 22V3c5-3 9 3 14 0v10c-5 3-9-3-14 0"/></svg><span>比赛</span></li><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 22V3c5-3 9 3 14 0v10c-5 3-9-3-14 0"/></svg><span>工作台参赛筹备 · 示例</span></li><li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" st