        <div data-wb-placement-host><section class="wb-placement" aria-labelledby="wb-placement-title">
        <div class="wb-placement-heading"><div><h2 id="wb-placement-title">像摆积木一样，搭好你的工作台</h2><p>选一块，放到右边。这里的位置，会直接成为你的工作台布局。</p></div><span class="wb-placement-count">22 块已放置</span></div>
        <div class="wb-placement-workspace"><aside class="wb-palette" aria-label="方块库"><header><h3>方块库</h3><p>直接拖到右边，也可点选后放下</p><button type="button" class="wb-palette-create" data-wb-action="create-block"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14 M5 12h14"/></svg> 自定义方块</button><button type="button" class="wb-palette-ai" data-wb-action="ask-miniapp"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 2.5 6.5L21 12l-6.5 2.5L12 21l-2.5-6.5L3 12l6.5-2.5z M20 2v4 M18 4h4"/></svg> 让 AI 造小工具</button></header>
        <label class="wb-palette-search"><span class="sr-only">搜索方块</span><input type="search" data-palette-search placeholder="搜索用途或名称" aria-label="搜索方块"></label>
