idth="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14 M5 12h14"/></svg><span>加入</span></button></article><article class="wb-material "><span class="wb-module-glyph" style="--wb-module-color:#63E6DC"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 12l2 2 5-5 M21 11v1a9 9 0 1 1-5-8"/></svg></span><div><h3>备忘与待办</h3><p>记录要做的事，安排日期与优先级。</p></div><button type="button" class="wb-add-button" data-wb-action="add" data-id="tasks"  aria-label="加入备忘与待办"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14 M5 12h14"/></svg><span>加入</span></button></article><article class="wb-material "><span class="wb-module-glyph" style="--wb-module-color:#9DC5FF"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 3v18h17 M8 16v-4 M13 16V7 M18 16v-7"/></svg></span><div><h3>生活回顾</h3><p>查看完成记录与学习活动。</p></div><button type="button" class="wb-add-button" data-wb-action="add" data-id="review"  aria-label="加入生活回顾"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14 M5 12h14"/></svg><span>加入</span></button></article><article class="wb-material "><span class="wb-module-glyph" style="--wb-module-color:#FFBC7C"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 8V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5a3 3 0 0 0 0 6h15v11H5a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V6 M20 12h-5v5h5 M16 14.5h